# For the Birds (otherAreas 104): the Prog 2 arm of GeFhu's trigger, per NM id: 17379786 and 17379787. Accepted at
# Prog 2 (GMs) with the Glittering Fragment. Each spawn arm at Prog 2: Prog 3, TAKEN_FROM_YOU, QUADAV_ARE_ATTACKING;
# Prog 2 again (a GM) before the kills. With only 17379787 up the arm runs (it is never read) and spawns the four
# (17379787 already up); the three others killed at Prog 3 count: Option 3.
# GeFhu Yagudoeye's spawn checks read MAGNES (17379784), MAGNES + 1 (17379785, NICKEL), NICKEL (17379785 again) and
# NICKEL + 1 (17379786); MAGNES + 3 (17379787, the second Nickel) is never read. Each round: the four up, the other
# three killed and their corpses left to despawn: one NM up: nil (HUURR); that one killed and gone: none up: the arm
# spawns the four again. The checks are split over four flows (two NMs each), with the char at level 99: one flow of
# every round left the char (at level 75, and again at 99) dead to the NM left up and a Beadeaux Emerald Quadav.
lists Beadeaux/GeFhu_Yagudoeye/onTrigger Beadeaux/Magnes_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/Nickel_Quadav_NM/onMobDeath Beadeaux/onEventFinish/124
char zone=Beadeaux pos=-89.9,-3.25,-127.8 job=WAR lvl=99
quest OtherAreas.ForTheBirds accepted
charvar Quest[4][104]Prog 2
keyitem GlitteringFragment
login
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 2, none up: Prog 3; four spawned; TAKEN_FROM_YOU; QUADAV_ARE_ATTACKING
charvar Quest[4][104]Prog 2             # a GM
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM                   # Prog 2: no count
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+1
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+3
tick 15000                              # the corpses despawning
tick 30000
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 2, only 17379786 up (NICKEL + 1): nil; HUURR
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+2
tick 15000
tick 30000
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # none up: Prog 3; four spawned; TAKEN_FROM_YOU; QUADAV_ARE_ATTACKING
charvar Quest[4][104]Prog 2             # a GM
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+1
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+2
tick 15000
tick 30000
trigger GeFhu_Yagudoeye                 # Prog 2, only 17379787 up (never read): Prog 3; the four spawned (787 up)
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+1                 # Prog 3: Option 1
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+2                 # Option 2
kill MAGNES_QUADAV_NM+3                 # Option 3
